      "componentAttributes" : {
        "irm_video_desc" : "You want a colocation provider you can trust, with a proven track record of protecting customers in times of change. That’s Iron Mountain. With our expanding footprint as a global data center leader, you can count on us to help enable your digital transformation. Here's our story!",
